{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a .txt file strategy guide for the game Forgotten Beginnings: A New Afterlife. A free sample of it is included with the game by default, in the install directory as &quot;strategy guide SAMPLE.txt&quot;. You can take a look at that so you have an idea of what you're getting with this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though not necessary to beat the game (it is linear, this would just streamline things), you can view it as an additional &quot;support me&quot; DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will show up in the game install directory in the folder &quot;Forgotten Beginnings - A New Afterlife Strategy Guide&quot; as &quot;strategy guide.txt&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867110?t=1752366677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867110?t=1752366677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867110/d715c1fa0b60dfabfbaab99f9bb92b676304344c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752366677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867110/d715c1fa0b60dfabfbaab99f9bb92b676304344c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752366677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a .txt file strategy guide for the game Forgotten Beginnings: A New Afterlife. A free sample of it is included with the game by default, in the install directory as &quot;strategy guide SAMPLE.txt&quot;. You can take a look at that so you have an idea of what you're getting with this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though not necessary to beat the game (it is linear, this would just streamline things), you can view it as an additional &quot;support me&quot; DLC.</p><p class=\"bb